{"c":[{"id":"84a4af324deddcaf","sum":"VS1: Disclosure composes at most 8 ways, so a request rebuilt after the verifier minted its parts as plan text needs 'plan' in its shape slot. Ask value options read 'Proposed value: \"…\". Source: …'; stand-ins match them with builders.ts optionIs.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261008T103634Z-c66a1e426ad50081","text":"VS1: Disclosure composes at most MAX_WAYS (8) ways; past that a text carries every reason of its parts, so a request rebuilt after the verifier minted its parts as plan text needs 'plan' in its shape slot.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261008T103634Z-ffaa923aad520f1c","text":"VS1: an Ask's value options state exact outputs ('Proposed value: \"…\". Source: …'); test stand-ins match them with test/builders.ts optionIs, while a fill on focus keeps its quoted-candidate criteria.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"78a720eef0312ba1","sum":"Generation stops at MAX_GENERATOR_VISITS, not time; no generator clock/budget override. stats.ms is diagnostic; visit caps mark partial cuts. Close page sessions before Helper.shutdown and Store.close or a trailing walk reaches the closed store.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261008T122806Z-20adf579b39b18f9","text":"Candidate generation stops at MAX_GENERATOR_VISITS, not elapsed time; no setGeneratorClock, budgetMs or --generator-clock override remains. stats.ms is diagnostic, and a visit-cap stop still marks a partial window cut.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261008T131449Z-7a0add213d3fc6e0","text":"Tests that wire page sessions into Helper must close those sessions before Helper.shutdown and Store.close; a scheduled trailing walk otherwise reaches a closed store.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
